  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rightlines: Drawing Fundamental Rights Policies and Actions at the Greek and Cypriot Borders</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By bringing together the International Organization for Migration, the Fundamental Rights Officer in Greece and the Police in Cyprus, while also consulting with other key stakeholders involved, the Action seeks to strengthen and streamline the protection and promotion of fundamental rights in border management activities in Greece and Cyprus, considering regional and national policies, priorities and identified needs.</narrative>
  </description>
